"kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - 0.12.0","summary":"Hello! A new version of the demo is now available!Let us know on Discord or forums what you thought about this version!New stuffSound design updatedBug fixes Fix some textsFix some tagsFix enemy pawn stuck in a dead end on a sector 1 map--Play the demo and send us your feedbacks ːfpyayːHave fun and fly safe!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:59:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1845383656393620","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - 0.11.0","summary":"Hello! A new version of the demo is now available!Let us know on Discord or forums what you thought about this version!Localization Added Simplified Chinese. Thanks to Loc3 https://loc-3.com/ for their work! Bug fixes - Fix saving game while on ship selection - Fix many item texts - Fix upgrades not related to items - Fix music when losing fight - Fix invisible inventory grid on macOS - Fix softlock when removing a breakdown that is still in space - Fix sector 2 / 3 starting point being playable","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T14:34:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393620","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1844115010504038","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - 0.10.0","summary":"Hello! A new version of the demo is now available!Let us know on Discord or forums what you thought about this version!# Content- Added 4 new events to sector 3- New shield items sprites# Balancing- Nerfed Lich't (+100% -> +50%)- Nerfed some T1 ennemies# QoL- Added item swap!Drop an item in another, even they can't merge they will trade places if it's possible- \"More\" crew: add cancel button# Bug fixes- Fix many effects texts- Fix resuming a run resulting in a black screen and softlock- Fix carg","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T12:19:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504038","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1844115010494929","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - 0.9.4","summary":"Hello! A new version of the demo is now available!Let us know on Discord or forums what you thought about this version!New Content- New sector 2 map: \"The web\"- Sector names now shown so you always know where you are.- English version reworked by Loc-3 LtdNew Features & Quality of Life- Run saving! Your run is preserved so you can pick up where you left off. Including onboarding.- Reworked Item Upgrade popup- Research now shows how many fights remain until it completes.Balancing- Enemies are tou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T14:08:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494929","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1843481262690144","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"update","title":"Demo: Major Update! New content, new systems, major rework","summary":"Hello! A new version of the demo is now available!If you played the previous one, you should see that we've reworked most points!We hope you'll like this new version, we think it is close to what should be the final game.Let us know on Discord or forums what you thought about this version!Now the changelog.FeaturesOnboardingFull onboarding flow: dedicated onboarding mapBurn (v2)Burn now sets the slots on fire.Each flame now has its own cooldownYou can boost Burn damages New burn items and burn a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T18:36:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690144","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1835236783563291","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - 0.4.1","summary":"Hello! Patch demo 0.4.1 deployed!Note : this will probably be our last demo update for the next coming months. We'll be breaking the code, the game and adding tons of content so we can release a new demo for Q4!FeaturesRework Repair StationsRework Cargo Delivery ScreenItems will now sell at 75% of their value once you leave the shopOptimize renderingAdd 2 new bosses, randomly picked on startClick on objective to see it on map FixesAvoid Multicast on items with no cooldownsFix burn/shield not cle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T12:18:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783563291","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1834602721186866","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - 0.4.0","summary":"Hello! Patch demo 0.4.0 deployed!This is an intermediary patch, we're in the middle of many changes and content adding but everything is not ready.What's in:- You can move on any accessible node on the map with move click- You can pan the map camera with right click- You can open a \"game log\" to know what's happening in the engine- We've completely rewrote the Stats engine, in the hope to limit bugsOther Cool things:- Auto fight end- Ship pieces on explosion- You can cancel the crew selectionAnd","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T08:30:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721186866","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1833968530891620","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - 0.3.3","summary":"Hello!We've updated the demo to fix the following issues:Fix stats bonuses not being removed/added properlyFix items losing cooldown and proc effect when max cooldown","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T16:11:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530891620","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1833968530887961","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Demo release","summary":"Hello!We’re very happy to announce that a new demo for our next game Cosmo Cargo is available:Embark in your ship, explore the galaxy and find powerful items and synergies and engage the fight against dreadful Administrators. Let us know what you think, have fun and fly safe!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T12:15:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530887961","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4028760-1826362059932798","game_id":"steam-4028760","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Cosmo Cargo + Playable Demo on Itch.io","summary":"Hello !At Pixelnest Studio, we’re back in 🪐SPACE🚀 with our new game!Cosmo Cargo is a roguelike PvE colorful-SciFi inventory autobattler where you fight to preserve chaos 